      "difficulty_level": "H2",
      "difficulty_reason": "The counted object includes the uniform direct semistable-concordance construction, not merely the final immediate inference of connectedness: it builds families joining fixed-determinant bundles, controls semistability via open loci and base changes/lifts of extension data, and supplies the geometric concordance criterion over field extensions used to identify A1 components. Original algebraically closed base, smooth projective genus>=2, rank/determinant and stable coprimality scope retained. Old flag-bundle connectedness supports later parabolic extensions, not this core semistable construction. Proposition and resulting main connectedness theorem count once together.",
